15:["$","p","p-11",{"children":"再 Kafka 中，我们要实现将消息写入到同一个分区，有 3 种思路："}]
16:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["配置 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"num.partitions=1"}]," 或者创建 topic 的时候指定只有 1 个分区，但这会显著降低 Kafka 的吞吐量。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"固定消息的 key"}],"，然后采用",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"key hash"}]," 的分区策略，这样就可以让所有消息都被分到同一个分区中。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["实现并指定",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"自定义分区策略"}],"，可以根据业务需求，将需要顺序消费的消息都分到固定一个分区中。"]}],"\n"]}]
17:["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"JAVA","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-java","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 如下例子，所有使用\"same-key\"作为key的消息都会被发送到同一个Partition"}],"\nProducerRecord<String, String> record = ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"new"}]," ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-title class_","children":"ProducerRecord"}],"<String, String>(",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"topic\""}],", ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"same-key\""}],", ",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"message\""}],");\nproducer.send(record);\n"]}]}]
