3a:["$","p","p-30",{"children":["RabbitMQ 在生产时没有生产分区分配的过程。它是通过 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Exchange"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Route Key"}]," 机制来实现顺序消息的。",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Exchange"}]," 会根据设置好的 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Route Key"}]," 将数据路由到不同的 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Queue"}]," 中存储。此时 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Route Key"}]," 的作用和 Kafka 的消息的 ",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Key"}]," 是一样的。"]}]
